WEBVTT

01:40.630 --> 01:45.820
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.420 --> 01:50.870
[Episode 6]

02:06.710 --> 02:09.970
All the crucial intelligence of the Yiqi Alliance is here.

02:11.630 --> 02:14.860
[A group of demons has gathered in the west of Water Ravine, many of whom are fierce tiger demons.]

02:12.520 --> 02:14.150
Just as you thought,

02:14.150 --> 02:16.700
although Master Nangong died, the Nangong family's influence remains.

02:16.700 --> 02:18.000
Nangong Chui is already on his way

02:18.000 --> 02:19.460
to the Inspection Bureau.

02:20.120 --> 02:22.250
He retrieved all of Mu Xiaowu's files.

02:22.910 --> 02:23.800
Let him do it.

02:24.300 --> 02:26.430
I hope he can be as stupid as possible,

02:26.450 --> 02:29.850
helping me remove the thorn in the Inspection Bureau's side.

02:30.860 --> 02:32.110
I knew it.

02:32.340 --> 02:33.150
You wouldn't just

02:33.150 --> 02:35.410
come here for the Yang family's wedding.

02:35.500 --> 02:37.440
This is also the reason why she hates me.

02:37.440 --> 02:38.250
She?

02:40.740 --> 02:44.590
Is the lady downstairs today Miss Dongfang?

02:48.530 --> 02:52.000
So this show is for her to see?

02:56.860 --> 02:58.840
It doesn't matter if the show fails.

02:58.840 --> 02:59.870
After all,

02:59.990 --> 03:01.850
Miss Wangquan will foot the bill.

03:10.240 --> 03:12.000
That's all. Thank you.

03:12.520 --> 03:14.000
Then I'll go wrap up the jewelry.

03:14.000 --> 03:15.530
Miss, please wait a moment.

03:28.530 --> 03:30.250
It's so beautiful.

03:30.960 --> 03:33.050
It's really pretty.

03:40.840 --> 03:41.870
Do you like it?

03:42.890 --> 03:43.940
I like it.

03:44.240 --> 03:45.570
Then I'll buy it for you.

03:45.910 --> 03:47.079
Thank you, Huaizhu.

03:47.190 --> 03:48.450
Let me put it on for you.

03:52.510 --> 03:53.980
It looks really nice.

03:55.280 --> 03:56.150
I like her.

03:57.120 --> 03:58.980
I must make her my sister-in-law.

04:07.520 --> 04:09.750
Go ahead and use whatever tricks you have left.

04:09.750 --> 04:11.000
Don't drag it on endlessly.

04:11.000 --> 04:11.560
Qinlan.

04:24.190 --> 04:25.710
Besides Ruyi Pavilion,

04:25.800 --> 04:28.800
the largest pavilion in the city is Yunjing Pavilion.

04:29.360 --> 04:31.240
The owner will stop you two then.

04:31.720 --> 04:34.790
He'll say, since it's the Lotus Viewing Festival today,

04:34.790 --> 04:37.250
there are two spots for drinking at the top.

04:37.659 --> 04:39.560
Upon seeing your gorgeous appearances,

04:39.560 --> 04:40.750
you're such a match made in heaven.

04:40.750 --> 04:42.950
He'll be willing to offer them for free.

04:43.240 --> 04:44.920
That fat Chen from Yunjing Pavilion

04:44.920 --> 04:46.159
is not a good person.

04:46.360 --> 04:49.090
He took several hundred taels as a bribe for this.

04:49.320 --> 04:51.590
The money certainly won't be refunded.

04:55.159 --> 04:56.120
Well,

04:56.240 --> 04:58.659
someone did a bad thing with good intentions.

04:58.659 --> 05:00.970
But if there has been bad blood between you two,

05:00.970 --> 05:02.790
you can still

05:02.810 --> 05:04.740
go up together for a pleasant chat.

05:10.680 --> 05:11.690
Qinlan,

05:12.600 --> 05:14.800
can you take the jewelry back to Yan?

05:17.960 --> 05:18.900
She agreed?

05:22.800 --> 05:24.920
Miss Qingmu Yuan actually made it.

05:43.270 --> 05:45.670
I've caused much disturbance to you today.

05:47.630 --> 05:49.490
Please forgive me, Miss Huaizhu.

05:55.159 --> 05:58.510
I should be the one to toast you first with this cup of wine.

05:58.920 --> 06:01.160
Thank you for your help, Young Master Wangquan.

06:01.160 --> 06:03.560
What you did has helped Yan find happiness.

06:21.040 --> 06:22.140
Let me toast you

06:22.920 --> 06:25.070
with this second cup of wine, to thank you again.

06:25.070 --> 06:27.200
What's the reason for this second cup?

06:28.510 --> 06:31.040
It's hard to get a table here for stargazing.

06:32.040 --> 06:34.920
I suppose Miss Qingmu and your sister

06:35.159 --> 06:36.690
must have spent quite a bit.

06:37.340 --> 06:40.100
Of course, it's all thanks to your favor.

06:51.510 --> 06:52.310
Miss Huaizhu,

06:53.310 --> 06:54.370
since you're here,

06:54.750 --> 06:57.040
we shouldn't let these countless stars go to waste.

06:57.040 --> 06:58.640
If you truly want to thank me,

06:59.070 --> 07:00.130
for this third cup,

07:01.240 --> 07:02.370
let's drink slowly.

07:23.720 --> 07:26.970
Miss Huaizhu, why do you like stargazing?

07:30.040 --> 07:33.680
Because under the stars are the stories of me and my family.

07:35.430 --> 07:36.760
Stories of your family?

07:38.950 --> 07:40.240
Sweet Yin Cakes,

07:40.560 --> 07:41.960
endless conversations,

07:42.490 --> 07:44.630
and the moment when we pointed at the starry sky

07:44.630 --> 07:46.240
to claim our own stars.

07:51.120 --> 07:52.560
So where is

07:53.360 --> 07:54.040
your star?

07:57.190 --> 07:58.830
It's still far away in the sky,

07:58.830 --> 07:59.950
but I'm certain

08:00.750 --> 08:02.550
that the star is definitely him.

08:10.210 --> 08:12.440
♪ The night breeze is gentle ♪

08:13.100 --> 08:16.030
♪ Rushing the sunset into dream ♪

08:15.120 --> 08:15.720
Huaizhu,

08:16.600 --> 08:17.160
actually I...

08:16.920 --> 08:19.440
♪ The fireflies fly in the night sky ♪

08:17.160 --> 08:18.490
Young Master Wangquan.

08:21.880 --> 08:23.920
♪ The wine warms my throat ♪

08:22.360 --> 08:23.600
This third cup of wine

08:24.330 --> 08:26.040
is to our respective well-being.

08:24.710 --> 08:27.570
♪ The lake is wrinkled ♪

08:26.360 --> 08:28.920
If you ever need my help in the future,

08:28.940 --> 08:31.550
♪ Waiting for you to dock by the riverside ♪

08:29.000 --> 08:30.510
please don't hesitate to ask.

08:30.510 --> 08:31.710
As for anything else,

08:32.510 --> 08:33.840
I have no intentions.

08:34.039 --> 08:36.919
♪ With appropriate makeup ♪

08:39.230 --> 08:42.049
♪ Even gentler than the moon ♪

08:40.270 --> 08:41.030
Farewell.

08:44.190 --> 08:45.510
♪ Though I haven't gotten close to you ♪

08:46.150 --> 08:47.900
♪ My heart is already fluttering ♪

08:48.970 --> 08:53.650
♪ Just like a dream of midsummer ♪

08:56.830 --> 08:58.850
♪ In the forest ♪

08:59.440 --> 09:01.440
♪ Wine drops fall ♪

09:02.230 --> 09:04.300
♪ At the tip of my heart ♪

09:04.960 --> 09:06.890
♪ Face blushing ♪

09:07.600 --> 09:09.530
♪ If I'm granted a wish ♪

09:10.060 --> 09:12.050
♪ I don't wish for anything else ♪

09:13.090 --> 09:14.890
♪ I only hope that God ♪

09:15.790 --> 09:17.230
♪ Will bless ♪

09:18.800 --> 09:21.280
♪ This love ♪

09:22.560 --> 09:25.920
♪ To last longer ♪

09:38.550 --> 09:40.030
Huaizhu, you were pretending to fall asleep.

09:40.030 --> 09:41.240
You tricked me!

09:41.240 --> 09:42.550
You're the one who plotted against me first.

09:42.550 --> 09:43.870
I was wrong! I was wrong!

09:43.870 --> 09:44.840
I was wrong!

09:46.080 --> 09:46.790
I was wrong.

09:46.790 --> 09:47.850
Alright, alright.

09:47.960 --> 09:49.600
Let's go find Yan later.

09:50.790 --> 09:52.370
But, Huaizhu,

09:52.840 --> 09:56.750
yesterday, after you went to the Star-Gazing Platform with that Wangquan,

09:56.750 --> 09:58.360
did anything happen?

09:59.080 --> 10:00.680
What could possibly happen?

10:13.270 --> 10:15.870
He even knows that you love Yin Cakes the most?

10:16.600 --> 10:17.600
What exactly do you see

10:17.600 --> 10:19.510
in that deceitful young master?

10:20.030 --> 10:22.120
It's like seeking fruit from a barren tree.

10:22.120 --> 10:23.360
Why waste time?

10:25.550 --> 10:27.440
Young Master Wangquan

10:27.600 --> 10:28.600
is not deceitful.

10:32.270 --> 10:33.030
Huaizhu.

10:33.910 --> 10:34.670
Hongye.

10:35.270 --> 10:37.630
Last night, there was a bright moon and sparse stars.

10:37.630 --> 10:40.240
Was there any progress

10:40.240 --> 10:42.370
between you two beneath the Milky Way?

10:43.010 --> 10:46.170
What kind of progress do you think we could make?

10:49.270 --> 10:50.330
What are you doing?

10:52.270 --> 10:53.910
There's no scent of rouge,

10:53.910 --> 10:57.170
which proves you two haven't had any intimate contact yet.

10:57.270 --> 10:58.030
Hongye,

10:58.270 --> 11:00.630
you haven't told Miss Huaizhu yet?

11:02.270 --> 11:03.780
Stop asking me all the time, you two.

11:03.780 --> 11:05.440
I'd like to ask you both

11:06.600 --> 11:08.800
if there's anything you want to tell me.

11:12.870 --> 11:13.750
Hongye,

11:14.080 --> 11:14.720
well...

11:14.720 --> 11:16.230
Alright, alright, alright.

11:16.230 --> 11:18.760
You don't have to take responsibility today.

11:19.030 --> 11:20.630
It was my idea.

11:21.000 --> 11:23.550
I took the wrong thing. I got the Wind and Rain Talisman instead.

11:23.550 --> 11:25.150
At most, I'll just get scolded a bit.

11:25.150 --> 11:26.510
They'll punish me by not allowing me to go on missions.

11:26.510 --> 11:27.770
I'm not afraid anyway.

11:27.870 --> 11:28.890
Everyone's on my side.

11:28.890 --> 11:30.200
I can go secretly.

11:30.440 --> 11:31.200
Indeed.

11:31.650 --> 11:33.450
It's not the first time, anyway.

11:38.000 --> 11:38.790
Thank you.

11:42.440 --> 11:44.470
So there were sparks,

11:44.630 --> 11:45.360
right?

11:46.320 --> 11:49.670
Yes, thanks to your careful arrangements,

11:50.270 --> 11:51.150
these sparks

11:51.320 --> 11:52.360
were quite big.

11:52.450 --> 11:54.660
See? I told you it would work.

11:55.460 --> 11:56.660
The sparks were so big

11:57.590 --> 11:59.050
that they burned to ashes.

12:11.720 --> 12:13.150
It's okay, it's okay, it's okay.

12:13.150 --> 12:15.720
If you want to win a fair lady's heart, you need to make an effort.

12:15.720 --> 12:18.580
We both like this potential sister-in-law anyway.

12:18.790 --> 12:20.050
Don't be discouraged.

12:20.840 --> 12:21.720
Enough.

12:22.510 --> 12:23.750
Today is the grand wedding.

12:23.750 --> 12:25.630
Some of the noble families might cause trouble.

12:25.630 --> 12:26.960
Let's all get prepared.

12:28.030 --> 12:29.230
As for other matters,

12:31.630 --> 12:32.630
let's just let nature take its course.

12:32.630 --> 12:33.150
Okay.

12:33.790 --> 12:35.480
How can we just let it be?

12:35.550 --> 12:36.670
We should strike while the iron is hot.

12:36.670 --> 12:38.080
If the first plan doesn't work, we can try a second one.

12:38.080 --> 12:38.630
Enough, Zui.

12:38.630 --> 12:39.320
-Let me tell you...
-Let’s go.

12:39.320 --> 12:40.520
I'm not finished yet.

12:40.720 --> 12:42.790
I'll come up with a second plan for you right away.

12:42.790 --> 12:44.890
Where should we go next time?

12:45.080 --> 12:45.630
Well.

12:45.630 --> 12:46.160
Let's go.

12:46.670 --> 12:48.270
Hongye, you can't give up.

12:48.270 --> 12:49.510
Hongye, keep it up!

12:51.150 --> 12:52.410
Why are you pulling me?

13:02.200 --> 13:04.650
Zui bought this for you yesterday.

13:06.240 --> 13:08.270
Even though people can't control the time when flowers bloom,

13:08.270 --> 13:09.930
when they scatter in the rain,

13:10.150 --> 13:11.550
you'll still be at a loss.

13:12.850 --> 13:14.710
When you think it's appropriate,

13:14.910 --> 13:15.750
give it to her.

13:39.270 --> 13:45.020
[Happy]

14:20.750 --> 14:23.510
You look so beautiful.

14:26.880 --> 14:28.610
Is my waist getting a bit thick?

14:29.320 --> 14:32.120
It's too early to show the pregnancy. Don't worry.

14:34.870 --> 14:35.820
Huaizhu,

14:37.030 --> 14:38.090
I am where I am today

14:39.240 --> 14:40.470
thanks to you.

14:40.600 --> 14:42.530
I don't have such great abilities.

14:43.840 --> 14:45.170
If it weren't for you...

14:50.510 --> 14:51.280
Miss,

14:51.320 --> 14:53.530
the groom's bridal sedan chair has arrived at the front gate of the mansion.

14:53.530 --> 14:54.990
He will be here any moment.

14:57.200 --> 15:00.130
Today, just be at ease and be the bride.

15:00.240 --> 15:03.000
Nothing else matters besides this.

15:22.750 --> 15:24.800
Today, the son of the Mu family

15:24.870 --> 15:28.240
is going to marry the noble daughter of the Yang family and join the bride's family.

15:28.240 --> 15:29.790
May they enjoy the peace.

15:29.910 --> 15:31.640
May he think as his wife thinks,

15:31.670 --> 15:33.500
do as his wife wishes,

15:33.600 --> 15:35.460
and regard his wife as his heaven.

15:35.600 --> 15:39.960
The auspicious time has come! The bride leaves her maiden home!

15:40.030 --> 15:43.320
Great! Great! Great!

15:51.510 --> 15:54.760
Great! Great! Great!

15:55.120 --> 15:56.920
I can't believe that Young Master Wangquan

15:56.920 --> 15:58.850
is actually the groom's best man.

16:01.550 --> 16:03.880
The groom presses down on the sedan chair.

16:06.740 --> 16:08.920
Why can't he even press down a single sedan chair?

16:08.920 --> 16:11.120
Indeed, he's so useless.

16:11.240 --> 16:12.900
Press down on the sedan chair.

16:13.870 --> 16:14.840
Haven't you noticed?

16:14.840 --> 16:17.670
The Yang family deliberately makes things difficult.

16:17.670 --> 16:20.120
What a waste, a beautiful flower stuck in cow dung.

16:20.120 --> 16:21.780
Press down on the sedan chair.

16:30.120 --> 16:31.270
Lift.

16:33.910 --> 16:35.030
Great! Great!

16:35.030 --> 16:37.120
The bride enters the sedan chair.

16:37.200 --> 16:39.750
Great! Great! Great!

16:49.910 --> 16:51.750
Lift the sedan chair.

16:52.600 --> 16:55.360
Great! Great! Great!

16:56.440 --> 16:58.390
Circle the mansion three times.

16:57.620 --> 16:59.240
♪ Qiao River is beside the interlaced branches ♪

16:58.550 --> 17:00.630
May everything go well.

16:59.810 --> 17:01.100
♪ You are so close to me ♪

17:01.120 --> 17:03.360
May their descendants multiply and thrive.

17:01.680 --> 17:04.400
♪ In the wind and moonlight, my amorous feelings linger ♪

17:03.720 --> 17:05.589
The first circle for peace.

17:05.079 --> 17:06.970
♪ You gallop on horseback ♪

17:05.720 --> 17:07.790
The second for prosperity.

17:07.430 --> 17:08.900
♪ As if you came as soon as you heard the news ♪

17:08.030 --> 17:11.920
The third for a wish to see each other year after year.

17:08.690 --> 17:11.510
[Clairvoyant Yang Residence]

17:09.300 --> 17:12.119
♪ You want to rekindle the stars in my eyes ♪

17:12.690 --> 17:14.359
♪ Through the troubled times filled with beacon fires and chaos ♪

17:14.859 --> 17:16.040
♪ We watch the spring blossoms and autumn fruits ♪

17:16.960 --> 17:19.970
♪ Only you make me feel at ease ♪

17:19.030 --> 17:21.750
Great! Great! Great!

17:20.390 --> 17:22.150
♪ I want to ♪

17:21.750 --> 17:22.680
Congratulations!

17:22.680 --> 17:24.589
Great! Great! Great!

17:22.790 --> 17:24.400
♪ Look into your eyes day after day ♪

17:24.750 --> 17:25.880
Congratulations!

17:24.950 --> 17:27.980
♪ But my heartfelt words are hidden behind my lips ♪

17:25.920 --> 17:28.680
Groom, according to the rules of marrying into the Yang family,

17:28.569 --> 17:31.580
♪ Watching you under the setting sun's afterglow ♪

17:28.830 --> 17:30.960
you need to switch positions with the bride.

17:30.960 --> 17:32.150
You must give this honored position on the right

17:31.980 --> 17:35.070
♪ Is so meaningful and lasting, just like a dream ♪

17:32.280 --> 17:33.590
to the bride.

17:36.670 --> 17:39.030
♪ In that distant light, it's all about ♪

17:40.110 --> 17:42.360
♪ The rest of my life that I'm longing for ♪

17:44.570 --> 17:45.810
♪ Time slips away ♪

17:46.770 --> 17:49.540
♪ In this life, I'm arrogant and overbearing just for you ♪

17:47.880 --> 17:49.620
Great! Great! Great!

17:50.850 --> 17:53.890
♪ I wish that from now on, when the flowers bloom ♪

17:55.160 --> 17:58.150
♪ We are all the same ♪

17:56.160 --> 17:58.070
Miss Huaizhu, please go in.

17:59.310 --> 18:00.220
Thank you very much.

18:00.220 --> 18:03.310
♪ Do you know the lovesickness that pierces deep into my bones? ♪

18:00.640 --> 18:01.270
Thanks.

18:01.400 --> 18:02.600
Let's go in, Huaizhu.

18:04.190 --> 18:07.070
♪ It makes me restrained yet infatuated ♪

18:06.790 --> 18:08.590
What are you looking at? Go!

18:08.130 --> 18:11.150
♪ Do you know the feeling of gathering the morning flowers in the evening? ♪

18:11.680 --> 18:14.880
♪ It's the most regrettable thing ♪

18:11.920 --> 18:13.350
The auspicious time has come.

18:13.350 --> 18:16.790
The bride and groom joyfully enter the decorated wedding hall.

18:15.790 --> 18:18.960
♪ Do you know that staying together for a lifetime ♪

18:19.670 --> 18:22.640
♪ Is the most beautiful vow I've ever made? ♪

18:23.360 --> 18:25.330
♪ Do you know your name ♪

18:26.060 --> 18:27.310
♪ Is the shortest love poem ♪

18:27.960 --> 18:32.930
♪ I've ever read? ♪

18:34.640 --> 18:36.110
A match made in heaven

18:36.270 --> 18:38.510
ties the knot happily.

18:38.960 --> 18:42.140
♪ Do you know the lovesickness that pierces deep into my bones? ♪

18:39.790 --> 18:42.680
Conduct the ceremony of worshipping heaven and earth.

18:42.680 --> 18:43.880
Bow.

18:42.830 --> 18:45.810
♪ It makes me greedy yet selfless ♪

18:46.920 --> 18:49.910
♪ Do you know ♪

18:49.400 --> 18:51.640
Give thanks to your parents who raised you

18:50.470 --> 18:53.470
♪ You've become my tear mole? ♪

18:51.790 --> 18:53.920
and ancestors who bless you.

18:54.340 --> 18:57.520
♪ Oh, do you know that even though time passes by ♪

18:54.480 --> 18:57.200
Conduct the ceremony of worshipping your parents.

18:57.200 --> 18:58.270
Bow.

18:58.380 --> 19:01.530
♪ I'll still be honest with you? ♪

19:01.750 --> 19:03.590
May your love last forever

19:02.260 --> 19:04.120
♪ Do you know the sunset ♪

19:03.720 --> 19:05.750
and you two hold hands throughout a hundred years of life together.

19:04.580 --> 19:05.890
♪ Is the warmest beginning ♪

19:06.000 --> 19:08.640
Conduct the ceremony of worshipping each other.

19:06.460 --> 19:12.010
♪ when I fell in love with you? ♪

19:08.920 --> 19:10.160
Bow.

19:13.350 --> 19:14.590
The ceremony is completed.

19:13.980 --> 19:16.000
♪ Do you know the sunset ♪

19:15.070 --> 19:17.110
Groom, serve the tea.

19:16.820 --> 19:18.060
♪ Is the warmest beginning ♪

19:19.030 --> 19:27.850
♪ when I fell in love with you? ♪

19:25.550 --> 19:27.880
From now on, you will take the Yang surname

19:27.960 --> 19:29.820
and be a member of the Yang family.

19:30.110 --> 19:30.920
Serve the tea.

19:44.440 --> 19:45.240
Please.

19:47.270 --> 19:48.930
Father, please drink the tea.

19:51.000 --> 19:51.750
Wait!

20:10.400 --> 20:13.260
Master Yang, before you drink his tea as his father,

20:13.550 --> 20:15.440
you might want to think thrice.

20:19.440 --> 20:20.510
Yan.

20:27.400 --> 20:28.830
Master Nangong,

20:29.160 --> 20:30.880
with such a grand display,

20:31.720 --> 20:33.240
what is your intention?

20:34.000 --> 20:35.590
With such a grand display,

20:36.880 --> 20:39.340
I'm naturally not here to drink wedding wine

20:39.550 --> 20:41.400
but to apprehend someone.

20:45.240 --> 20:47.500
Young Master Wangquan, you're here too.

20:48.070 --> 20:49.400
Young Master Wangquan,

20:49.640 --> 20:51.510
guess who the Inspection Bureau

20:51.680 --> 20:53.830
will arrest today?

20:54.510 --> 20:55.680
On this joyous day,

20:56.070 --> 20:58.400
the Inspection Bureau is so aggressive.

20:58.680 --> 21:00.610
Are you targeting our Yang family?

21:03.350 --> 21:05.110
On the contrary,

21:06.030 --> 21:08.270
I'm here to save the Yang family.

21:09.440 --> 21:11.750
Since the Inspection Bureau is here on official business,

21:11.750 --> 21:14.070
let's handle this officially.

21:14.590 --> 21:17.640
Yitan, take the newlyweds to rest.

21:18.240 --> 21:19.000
Wait.

21:22.640 --> 21:23.970
Young Master Wangquan,

21:24.510 --> 21:26.310
I'm terribly sorry,

21:27.240 --> 21:30.570
but the accomplice to a demon murder I'm here to arrest today

21:31.240 --> 21:32.840
is none other than the groom,

21:33.270 --> 21:34.640
Mu Renzhi!

21:38.830 --> 21:39.750
Nangong Chui,

21:40.110 --> 21:42.240
you claim Mu Renzhi is an accomplice.

21:42.440 --> 21:43.840
Do you have any evidence?

21:46.050 --> 21:49.620
The carp demon that Mu Renzhi secretly released

21:49.830 --> 21:51.300
killed someone

21:51.510 --> 21:54.300
in broad daylight and in front of everyone.

21:54.440 --> 21:55.900
You're talking nonsense!

21:55.960 --> 21:58.560
Chu Jing is very tame.

21:58.640 --> 21:59.840
He won't kill anyone.

22:03.240 --> 22:04.640
Everyone, listen to him.

22:04.720 --> 22:07.510
He publicly defended a demon.

22:08.380 --> 22:11.070
He's surely an accomplice to the demon sympathizer!

22:11.070 --> 22:12.330
If someone was killed,

22:12.720 --> 22:13.980
where's the murderer?

22:14.590 --> 22:17.320
Bring him here, and I'll interrogate him myself.

22:20.110 --> 22:21.680
The murderer is on the run.

22:21.750 --> 22:23.270
Then how can you say there's an accomplice?

22:23.270 --> 22:25.550
If Mu Xiaowu hadn't released the demon,

22:25.830 --> 22:27.200
the demon wouldn't have caused trouble,

22:27.200 --> 22:28.240
and no one would have died.

22:28.240 --> 22:29.920
This is a baseless accusation.

22:29.920 --> 22:33.240
I'll consider this an abuse of your authority.

22:33.960 --> 22:35.290
Young Master Wangquan,

22:35.880 --> 22:37.440
would you like me to describe

22:37.440 --> 22:39.030
the scene at that time?

22:43.640 --> 22:44.750
Murder!

22:46.110 --> 22:47.030
Murder!

22:47.070 --> 22:48.110
Murder!

22:50.060 --> 22:52.270
[Chu Jing, the carp demon]

22:53.960 --> 22:55.290
Young Master Wangquan,

22:56.300 --> 22:59.150
I know you bailed Mu Xiaowu out of prison,

23:00.030 --> 23:02.430
but with everything that has happened now,

23:02.510 --> 23:04.280
your continued protection

23:04.680 --> 23:06.590
is a bit unreasonable.

23:07.000 --> 23:09.000
Since you have the nerve to question me,

23:09.000 --> 23:10.530
it shows you came prepared.

23:10.680 --> 23:13.790
Then this matter is an internal affair of the Yiqi Alliance.

23:13.790 --> 23:15.400
All irrelevant personnel can leave.

23:15.400 --> 23:19.720
I will deal with the Inspection Bureau face-to-face.

23:20.510 --> 23:22.640
Let's go, let's go. Hurry, move along.

23:30.270 --> 23:31.070
Yitan.

23:31.750 --> 23:33.480
Take the two newlyweds to rest.

23:33.790 --> 23:34.590
Got it.

23:49.790 --> 23:51.120
Young Master Wangquan,

23:52.000 --> 23:53.350
the demon is cunning.

23:53.640 --> 23:55.640
I can't find any trace of him for now.

23:56.070 --> 23:58.240
If you insist on seeing him,

23:58.590 --> 24:00.790
isn't that asking too much?

24:00.960 --> 24:04.220
The Inspection Bureau arrests people indiscriminately.

24:04.750 --> 24:06.680
Isn't that asking too much as well?

24:08.070 --> 24:10.960
If the Inspection Bureau can't catch the murderer,

24:11.750 --> 24:13.720
should we let Mu Xiaowu

24:13.720 --> 24:16.200
roam free forever?

24:19.270 --> 24:21.670
I will personally go to catch the murderer.

24:21.880 --> 24:23.240
Before I return,

24:23.790 --> 24:25.920
do not touch the Yang family in any way.

24:28.510 --> 24:29.400
Young Master,

24:31.400 --> 24:32.790
how can you prove that?

24:34.000 --> 24:35.830
And why should I believe you?

24:38.960 --> 24:40.110
If you keep nagging,

24:40.590 --> 24:42.070
I will lose my patience.

24:44.110 --> 24:45.070
Fine.

24:45.510 --> 24:47.270
Then I'll stay here today

24:47.400 --> 24:49.880
and wait for your triumphant return.

25:01.000 --> 25:02.000
I believe Yan.

25:02.400 --> 25:04.510
That carp demon must be innocent.

25:04.720 --> 25:06.350
The Inspection Bureau's actions today

25:06.350 --> 25:08.410
are targeting me and the Yang family.

25:08.440 --> 25:10.110
The one framing us behind the scenes

25:10.110 --> 25:11.310
must be Nangong Chui.

25:13.790 --> 25:14.400
Hongye.

25:15.030 --> 25:15.510
Yitan.

25:15.880 --> 25:17.880
I will personally bring back the witness.

25:17.880 --> 25:19.000
Before I return,

25:19.110 --> 25:20.510
you must protect everyone.

25:20.510 --> 25:22.440
Do not hand over Mu Xiaowu under any circumstances.

25:22.440 --> 25:23.170
Understood.

25:23.350 --> 25:25.030
I'm leaving Zui here to keep you company.

25:25.030 --> 25:26.510
If you have any concerns that are hard to express,

25:26.510 --> 25:27.720
just let her cause some trouble.

25:27.720 --> 25:28.440
Got it.

25:28.680 --> 25:29.750
I'll go with you.

25:32.150 --> 25:33.270
You're the smartest.

25:33.270 --> 25:34.440
Stay with the Yang family.

25:34.440 --> 25:35.790
If there's any sign of trouble,

25:35.790 --> 25:37.880
send a message through Huadian, the forehead makeup.

25:37.880 --> 25:39.070
His visit this time

25:39.240 --> 25:40.680
won't end peacefully.

25:40.920 --> 25:41.750
So what?

25:44.110 --> 25:44.910
Let's go then.

25:59.350 --> 26:00.550
Master Nangong,

26:02.070 --> 26:04.070
how's your leg injury?

26:04.880 --> 26:07.200
It seems to be getting worse, doesn't it?

26:16.830 --> 26:19.230
Thank you for your concern, Miss Wangquan.

26:20.160 --> 26:22.200
I can still manage to walk a bit.

26:23.160 --> 26:23.960
Is that so?

26:24.750 --> 26:27.750
Could it be that the Nangong family has done so many bad things

26:27.750 --> 26:30.750
that karma is coming back to bite you?

26:33.110 --> 26:35.270
Master Nangong, please have a seat.

26:41.440 --> 26:44.880
Wangquan Hongye has maintained a low profile over the past years.

26:44.880 --> 26:46.280
As soon as my father died,

26:46.790 --> 26:49.120
you don't even bother to pretend anymore.

26:49.590 --> 26:51.120
However, the Yiqi Alliance

26:51.590 --> 26:54.450
isn't under the control of your family alone, is it?

26:54.510 --> 26:56.030
Well, I'd like to know

26:56.030 --> 26:57.510
which family is so unwise.

26:59.110 --> 27:01.270
Stop trying to get information out of me.

27:01.270 --> 27:02.600
You've gotten smarter.

27:03.160 --> 27:04.590
But with your leg injury,

27:04.720 --> 27:05.750
you're not planning to

27:05.750 --> 27:07.310
wait here until Hongye returns, are you?

27:07.310 --> 27:09.830
Indeed, Master Nangong,

27:10.110 --> 27:12.640
you should return to the Inspection Bureau first.

27:12.640 --> 27:13.510
As you can see,

27:13.510 --> 27:15.200
today is a joyous occasion.

27:15.400 --> 27:17.790
We can't lose too much face.

27:20.720 --> 27:21.680
Master Yang,

27:22.440 --> 27:26.680
if you're afraid of losing face, don't marry your daughter to such a useless man.

27:26.680 --> 27:30.070
My suggestion is that Mu Renzhi be directly handed over to us

27:30.070 --> 27:31.920
and taken back to the Inspection Bureau.

27:31.920 --> 27:34.000
When Wangquan Hongye returns,

27:34.000 --> 27:36.510
we can deal with them all together.

27:37.160 --> 27:39.590
Didn't Young Master Wangquan just say...

27:39.720 --> 27:41.680
The Yiqi Alliance stands united,

27:41.880 --> 27:44.810
and we will never wrongly accuse an innocent person.

27:45.880 --> 27:50.510
Master Yang, you wouldn't rely on your good relations with the Wangquan family

27:50.790 --> 27:53.270
to disrespect the Inspection Bureau, would you?

27:53.270 --> 27:55.160
Though the Wangquan family is powerful,

27:55.160 --> 27:57.240
they can't cover up all the dirty business

27:57.240 --> 27:59.750
of your Yang family, can they?

28:04.440 --> 28:05.350
Well,

28:06.110 --> 28:07.830
if I hand over Renzhi to you,

28:08.200 --> 28:10.310
can you guarantee fair treatment?

28:13.510 --> 28:14.790
Of course.

28:18.200 --> 28:19.030
Guards!

28:19.440 --> 28:20.240
Wait!

28:22.990 --> 28:25.140
Many things have happened in the Yang family today.

28:25.140 --> 28:26.840
My grandfather is exhausted, both physically and mentally.

28:26.840 --> 28:28.370
He needs to rest privately.

28:28.510 --> 28:29.910
Please see our guest out.

28:30.030 --> 28:31.510
Yitan, Yitan.

28:31.510 --> 28:32.430
Yang Huanzhou,

28:33.200 --> 28:35.600
who's really in charge in your Yang family?

28:36.200 --> 28:36.830
Guards!

28:37.200 --> 28:37.680
Yes!

28:38.270 --> 28:39.270
See the guest out!

28:40.920 --> 28:43.720
Young Master Yang, think it over carefully.

28:45.790 --> 28:46.590
Yang Li.

28:46.750 --> 28:47.510
Yes.

28:49.200 --> 28:50.880
See Master Nangong out.

28:50.960 --> 28:52.360
Master Nangong, please.

29:10.300 --> 29:11.450
Yang Yitan,

29:11.960 --> 29:13.030
do you know

29:13.030 --> 29:14.750
who you're talking to?

29:18.960 --> 29:20.070
Master Nangong,

29:21.830 --> 29:23.290
don't make me take action.

29:52.270 --> 29:54.000
-Young Master.
-Young Master.

29:55.240 --> 29:56.670
Help me up.

30:01.960 --> 30:03.700
Listen to me carefully,

30:04.680 --> 30:07.790
if I step out of this doorway today,

30:08.160 --> 30:11.620
your Clairvoyant Yang family will never have another chance!

30:12.000 --> 30:14.400
Live or die. It's your choice.

30:14.720 --> 30:17.160
I, Wangquan Zui, have always been lawless,

30:17.310 --> 30:19.680
and I'm not as easy to deal with as the Yang family.

30:19.680 --> 30:20.550
Get lost.

30:22.160 --> 30:22.960
Let's go!

30:32.590 --> 30:34.370
This is outrageous!

30:36.830 --> 30:38.070
How dare the Yang family

30:38.070 --> 30:40.530
show such disrespect to our Nangong family?

30:40.880 --> 30:43.880
Doesn't the Yang family still have a few placer mines?

30:44.000 --> 30:46.070
Send someone to find some excuses

30:46.680 --> 30:49.350
and shut down all those mines today!

30:49.440 --> 30:50.200
Got it!

30:53.720 --> 30:54.510
Master.

30:56.240 --> 30:58.550
The Yang family is not a threat, no matter what.

30:58.550 --> 31:00.030
The most important thing right now is

31:00.030 --> 31:01.200
that we absolutely can't let Wangquan Hongye

31:01.200 --> 31:02.240
find that demon.

31:03.350 --> 31:04.680
That's easy enough.

31:06.550 --> 31:08.740
He committed murder in public.

31:09.070 --> 31:10.730
The evidence is irrefutable.

31:10.920 --> 31:12.720
Just kill him and be done with it.

31:13.240 --> 31:14.000
Master,

31:14.480 --> 31:17.160
that demon stole my demon-controlling talisman

31:17.160 --> 31:18.570
and has disappeared without a trace.

31:18.570 --> 31:20.160
But please rest assured, Master.

31:20.160 --> 31:21.510
We are doing everything in our power.

31:21.510 --> 31:22.720
We'll not let Wangquan Hongye

31:22.720 --> 31:25.110
find the whereabouts of that demon before us!

31:25.110 --> 31:25.920
Get lost!

31:32.200 --> 31:33.590
Add two more of these.

31:33.720 --> 31:34.550
How about this one?

31:34.550 --> 31:35.310
Does it look good on me?

31:35.310 --> 31:36.500
And...

31:36.640 --> 31:38.110
Add three more jade pieces.

31:38.110 --> 31:39.440
Young Master Wangquan.

31:40.680 --> 31:42.010
Young Master Wangquan.

31:44.750 --> 31:46.160
What brings you here to buy today?

31:46.160 --> 31:47.760
I'm here to buy information.

31:51.310 --> 31:52.910
Together with Miss Huaizhu.

31:57.680 --> 31:58.750
Please follow me.

32:19.640 --> 32:21.960
Miss Huaizhu, I wonder if you know

32:21.980 --> 32:24.380
about this world-renowned Ruyi Pavilion.

32:24.970 --> 32:26.400
Of course I do.

32:26.830 --> 32:29.060
The Qingmu family's silver shops are spread across the world,

32:29.060 --> 32:31.400
which has formed an intelligence network.

32:31.400 --> 32:34.330
Each silver shop serves as an intelligence station.

32:35.790 --> 32:37.240
I wonder, Miss Dongfang,

32:37.350 --> 32:39.750
if you've ever seen the real Ruyi Pavilion.

32:46.600 --> 32:47.360
Alright.

33:20.100 --> 33:21.550
Words will be formed with the smoke.

33:21.550 --> 33:25.210
Miss Dongfang, please ask about the information you want to know.

33:38.300 --> 33:42.490
[Find Chu Jing, the carp demon]

33:44.030 --> 33:47.270
I guess Miss Qingmu's eight branch stores

33:47.270 --> 33:48.680
all have this water platform.

33:48.680 --> 33:50.340
On top of each water platform,

33:50.350 --> 33:52.510
there should now be these six characters, right?

33:52.510 --> 33:53.720
You're correct.

33:53.910 --> 33:55.510
How much longer will it take?

33:55.970 --> 33:57.300
Young Master Wangquan,

33:57.750 --> 33:59.200
if you want to expedite it,

33:59.200 --> 34:00.800
it will cost extra, you know.

34:02.030 --> 34:02.960
Ms. Qingmu.

34:10.510 --> 34:15.310
Murderer on Suzhou Mansion's front street. Major Criminal of the Inspection Bureau.

34:16.510 --> 34:18.030
This is the person you're looking for?

34:17.600 --> 34:19.179
[Murderer on Suzhou Mansion's front street] [Major Criminal of the Inspection Bureau]

34:19.510 --> 34:21.760
It's said that this demon is inherently kind.

34:21.760 --> 34:24.489
There must be more to the story behind the murder.

34:25.440 --> 34:27.150
Ruyi Pavilion only gathers information,

34:27.150 --> 34:28.440
without judging good or evil.

34:28.440 --> 34:30.840
The Ruyi Pavilion in Suzhou is highly efficient in handling information collection.

34:30.840 --> 34:31.960
Please wait a moment.

34:31.960 --> 34:33.360
We'll have news soon.

34:35.219 --> 34:40.040
[Li family's dye workshop in Suzhou]

34:40.280 --> 34:42.139
Li family's dye workshop in Suzhou.
